Z||000001||1FST2M6||03-01-2001||10:48 AM||||I saw no performance gain from stock to Ocelot.. 1-2hp and maybe 3 lbft of torque. the best system i've found was a single in single out Flowmaster or Brullen. 2.5" with matching cat. yeah you'll be gimpy with only one tip but thats all the guy next to you with the  Ocelot will see... taillights and tips.<P>(ran my car on the dyno with stock, ocelot, camaro dual x-flow flowmaster, and 2.5" single in/out 40 series) <P>just my findings... your results may be a bit different...  ||||reg||1
